{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id179214345"}, "name":{"label":"mag.a"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-01-19T22:05:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.7.3"}, "id":{"label":"9526614891"}, "title":{"label":"Nice idea, 2 issues"}, "content":{"label":"1. The stars in the Nepal scene... they don’t move like real stars. I realize this is not an easy shot as an astrophotographer myself, but honestly looks a bit lazy. This could be done better. Because I’m really only interested in night scenes, there isn’t much else for me without paying.\n2. For me, price is too high. It looks like you used to have a pay for scene model? At any rate, this would be like paying spotify for a single artist. I understand why the subscription model, I just don’t think the price is justified for the volume of new material. For those reasons, I’m out.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1436994560&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id115797850"}, "name":{"label":"Joe Slagle"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-01-19T09:13:35-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.7.3"}, "id":{"label":"9524832319"}, "title":{"label":"Wonderful App"}, "content":{"label":"I am so thankful for this app. I suffer from PTSD and depression and I have been able to put on my headphones in moments of anxiety and despair to help me calm. This app is a godsend and I’m so thankful to the Portal staff.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1436994560&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id28978245"}, "name":{"label":"Apps & Music"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-01-19T07:12:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.7.3"}, "id":{"label":"9524485672"}, "title":{"label":"Just one feature missing for me."}, "content":{"label":"The thing preventing me from jumping on board is the ability to pause at a specific time. You have pause after time period, and alarm at specific time, but what I really want is for the sound to just fade away at a certain time (6:00am for example) every day. Thanks!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1436994560&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
