{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id218119046"}, "name":{"label":"Michaelcortez44"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-01-17T17:40:49-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"9519037581"}, "title":{"label":"Sony WH-1000XM4 Headphones"}, "content":{"label":"Will the spatial audio work on these headphones? I bought these for $350 and I don’t feel like spending the money to get the subscription if it is not compatible… let alone buy another pair of headphones for $200+.\n\nI gave this review 3 stars because although I have not purchased the subscription (yet) these apps seems very soothing and promising!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1436994560&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id36213375"}, "name":{"label":"sam.shaker"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-01-13T19:15:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"9504843342"}, "title":{"label":"Soothing app for work, play or resting"}, "content":{"label":"At first it seems a little pricey, but, while I’ve only been using the app for a week, I can already say, particularly when synced with the lighting, the app is amazingly soothing. I’ve signed up for a year, but I expect I will move to a lifetime subscription when it renews.  The app is smooth and mostly intuitive. There are a couple things it’s easy to miss and even easier to not see why you would want that feature turned on. If you choose to evaluate, try out Summer Thunderstorm with the lighting synced and auto lock disabled.  \n\nOne trivial bit of feedback to the developers: I’ve referred this application to several people now. Two of them had seen it in the store and assumed it was something to do with the game of the same name, so not looked any closer.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1436994560&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
