{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1471684312"}, "name":{"label":"Betsy Bebop"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-01-08T01:40:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"9484358620"}, "title":{"label":"There’s a difference between a need and a want."}, "content":{"label":"ThisApp is a need. Any heavy anxiety that weighs onto my chest is immediately lifted! I couldn’t be more grateful for those that made this app possible God bless you.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1436994560&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id87505022"}, "name":{"label":"Gilgamensch!"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-12-27T13:37:23-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"9441562530"}, "title":{"label":"Really cool, way too expensive"}, "content":{"label":"Cool app love the presentation, but way too expensive. Spotify and YouTube are considerably cheaper alternatives (or even free). I looked the company up, they got $5m in seed funding in 2022 their shift from a one time purchase to subscription model was probably at the behest of their VC overlords. Or maybe they’re just greedy, neither option makes me want to give them a cent. Apps ain’t cheap and I love the sound quality, spatial audio integration and HomeKit integration but not at the current offered price point(s). Not even close.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1436994560&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"3"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
