{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id745414407"}, "name":{"label":"PilotAcrobat"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-12-20T22:58:00-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"9418764736"}, "title":{"label":"Great app, bit too expensive."}, "content":{"label":"Please humble yourself, $10 a month used to get you hundreds and hundreds of TV shows and movies on Netflix. This is a few audio clips with a built in alarm clock, it shouldnt be more than $5 a month maximum (and no, yearly sub discounts dont actually count). This content is already available on Spotify premium which is cheaper and has astronomically more sounds than this. And its even free on youtube if you can ignore ads or have adblock.\n\nIts a beautiful app, and I love white noise to sleep. But until you lower your prices to at least appear to not be disgustingly greedy, you won’t have my respect. Subscription models are already predatory as they are. Do better.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1436994560&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
