{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id10188926"}, "name":{"label":"Hirodashi"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-12-07T20:27:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"9372567086"}, "title":{"label":"Using daily for various purposes"}, "content":{"label":"5 minutes before work I use focus mode and watch waves crash with my noise canceling headphones. It really locks me into the scene.\n\nOn cold days I like to double down with a snowy scene where the wind and Dali g snowflakes are audible.\n\nAt bedtime I like the American Heartland thunderstorm,  solemn yet powerful.\n\nThe spacial audio tracks sound great, and with noise cancelling headphones it can make a noisy coffee shop a completely different experience.\n\nI pad for a year of premium content because I want this app to grow and grow!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1436994560&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id38196757"}, "name":{"label":"Jgman100"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-11-29T02:17:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"9341165775"}, "title":{"label":"Spatial Audio not working"}, "content":{"label":"I had dynamic enabled, and airpod pro spatial audio set to head tracking.\n\nThe app registers movement, but when I look at the settings under AirPods, it shows spatial audio not available.\n\nI switched to older AirPods without spatial audio and the sounds were basically the same. \n\nI was really hoping for a true spatial audio experience. But this feels more emulated than a true spatial audio driven approach.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1436994560&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
