{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id137772887"}, "name":{"label":"Shcire"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-09-22T21:07:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.6.1"}, "id":{"label":"9112217205"}, "title":{"label":"Good and improving"}, "content":{"label":"I really enjoy the app and the soundscapes. Feels very inviting. This is arguably the best actively supported app available for spatial audio soundscapes. Some of the earlier recordings sound muffled (especially water scenes) but with each new release the quality of the audio recordings and capturing techniques increases. Please continue to bring in new high fidelity content.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1436994560&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1090886142"}, "name":{"label":"thanking out of the box"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-09-13T14:32:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.6.1"}, "id":{"label":"9081943711"}, "title":{"label":"Not what i expected"}, "content":{"label":"When I got this app I thought you would be able to hear your footsteps on the dirt paths, hear the birds chirping above you, and look up and see the glorious peeks of Rocky Mountain National Park, but it’s not like that at all. I said before that you want to hear the birds, which I did, but the footsteps weren’t in there, the rocky, beautiful experience of the mountains wasn’t in there, I guess I might be expecting too much, but if you want something immersive and you want to basically go on a vacation without actually going there, this isn’t the app for you.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1436994560&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
